* text=auto eol=lf
*.cs text
*.ps1 text
*.md text
*.json text
*.asmdef text
*.meta text
*.unity text
*.asset text
*.bin binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.fbx binary
*.png binary
*.tga binary
*.glb binary
# Unity serializes empty YAML scalar values with a trailing space; retain native output.
*.meta whitespace=-blank-at-eol
*.unity whitespace=-blank-at-eol
*.asset whitespace=-blank-at-eol
*.mat whitespace=-blank-at-eol
